  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - 9.1\tThe proposed single storey rear extension to the existing ground floor flat fails to comply with Policies B.1.1 - New Development and H.6.4 - Extensions and Alterations of the Unitary Development Plan 2003, and exceeds the maximum depth for rear extensions to terraced houses set by the Residential Extension Guidelines.  The extension would be likely to unduly impact on the amenity of the neighbouring property to the north by reducing light and sunlight, and would not harmonise with the neighbouring properties.  The plans have inconsistencies relating to the position of proposed windows and doors thereby making an assessment of amenity effects on adjoining properties not possible."
